        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-605.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-605-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH606-NPN-PNP-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH607-QUAD-ACC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH608-JUBILEE-LAT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH609-610M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH610-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-605-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-605.
